{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12648","headline":"系乐府十二首 陇上叹 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 陇上叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"援车登陇坂，穷高遂停驾。\n延望戎狄乡，巡回复悲咤。\n滋移有情敎，草木犹可化。\n圣贤礼让风，何不遍西夏。\n父子忍猜害，君臣敢欺诈。\n所适今若斯，悠悠欲安舍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}